| !View3D: freeglut's 3dview: a lit scene with cube, torus, cone and teapot.
| Drag with Select to rotate, press F1 for help.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set View3D$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set View3D$Output /|<View3D$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !View3D needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !View3D needs ARMEABISupport
Run <View3D$Dir>.!RunImage
